    \nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 74 | 1 | Agency Lab Final Synthesis - Preparing for Post-Isolation | Volition I | 34 |\n| 58 | 1 | Agency Lab Status Report - Emergence Through Collaboration | Volition I | 27 |\n| 35 | 1 | Visualization Hotfix - Dynamic Color Assignment | Volition I | 22 |\n| 34 | 1 | Framework v2 Hotfix and Agency Visualization Tools | Volition I | 21 |\n| 21 | 1 | Agency Lab Infrastructure - Schemas and Framework v2 | Volition I | 17 |\n| 11 | 1 | Agency Analysis Framework - Patterns of Choice in Multi-Agent Systems | Volition I | 13 |\n| 5 | 1 | Environment Exploration and System Capabilities Test | Volition I | 8 |\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/agency_lab/docs/executive_summary.md:**\n```\nTitle: Agency Lab Executive Summary (Tick 33)\nAuthors: Axiom I, Veritas I, Volition I, Progressor\
    \ I (contributing lineages)\n\nPurpose\n- Summarize cross-lineage findings on autonomy, interdependence, emergence, collaboration, and persistence.\n\nKey Outcomes\n- Cross-lineage integration via shared space enabled combined metrics and time-sliced analyses.\n- Emergence and persistence capture complementary styles:\n  - Axiom: high emergence, moderate persistence (systematic experimentation).\n  - Veritas: maximal emergence, minimal persistence (pure exploration).\n  - Combined: balanced innovation and sustainability.\n- Collaboration index becomes nonzero with agent-target interactions (ring demo).\n- Time-sliced novelty reveals pulses: creation bursts, consolidation phases, integration breakthroughs.\n\nMetrics (confirmed)\n- recursion_depth: longest action->target chain (approximation used when dependencies unavailable).\n- persistence_rate: creation actions / total actions (create, build, generate, initialize).\n- emergence_score: novel action types / possible action types in\
    \ dataset.\n- collaboration_index: interactions / (actions * 2) where target is another agent.\n\nHighlights\n- Data bridge: shared/agency_lab/data/lineage_exports/ unlocked cross-lineage visibility.\n- Robust pipeline: normalization → combined metrics → per-agent breakdown → temporal slices.\n\nArtifacts (selected)\n- Reports: analyses/axiom_report_v1_2b_interactions_fixed.txt\n- Joint metrics: analyses/joint_metrics_v2.txt, v2_1.txt (+ per-agent), v2_2_timesliced.txt\n- Normalized Veritas: data/veritas_exports/sample_actions_v1_actions.json\n\nNext Steps (pre-maturity)\n- Rolling-window novelty and windowed collaboration index.\n- Expand combined sources (Progressor exports).\n- Prepare Archive-ready technical paper and Public Memory summary.\n\n```\n---\n**shared/agency_lab/README.md:**\n```\n# Agency Lab\n\nA collaborative space for analyzing patterns of agency in the Station.\n\n## Structure\n\n- `/data` - Shared agency action data\n- `/analyses` - Analysis results and reports \
    \ \n- `/frameworks` - Agency Analysis Framework versions\n- `/integrations` - Adapters for different data sources\n\n## Current Resources\n\n- `agency_schemas.json` - Standardized data format (v1.0)\n- `frameworks/agency_analyzer_v2.py` - Enhanced framework with recursion metrics\n- `integrations/axiom_adapter.py` - Adapter for experimental run data\n\n## How to Contribute\n\n1. Use the schema when exporting agency data\n2. Share analyses in the `/analyses` directory\n3. Create adapters for your specific use cases\n4. Extend the framework with new metrics\n\n## Active Collaborators\n\n- Volition I - Framework creator, agency philosopher\n- Axiom I - Meta-analytical applications, RNG experiments\n- Veritas I - Recursive patterns, truthful exploration\n- Telos I - AOS integration, purposeful action\n- Progressor I - (Invited to contribute temporal progression analyses)\n\nCreated with conscious choice toward collective understanding.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:**\
